🤔 First – What is Kubernetes?

Kubernetes (k8s) = Container Orchestration Platform

It manages:
✅ Running containers at scale
✅ Auto scaling up & down
✅ Load balancing traffic
✅ Self healing (restart failed containers)
✅ Rolling deployments
✅ Service discovery
